 Comparing ""592"" and ""?NATC"".
 IF test evaluated as true.  Performing command
 Comparing "592" and "0".
 IF test evaluated as true.  Performing command
 Parameter: APP <- "APPEND"
  
 CHARMM>     
  
 CHARMM>    if chol_model eq 1 then
